            0.12,
            0.854,
            0.225
          ],
          "content": "Aman accidentally spilt vinegar on some pieces of an eggshell or marble and noticed bubbling. He then poured a soap solution on another piece of eggshell or marble, but no bubbles appeared. Why did bubbles occur with vinegar but not with soap solution?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
